{title: Kalley Heiligenthal - Your Praise Will Ever Be On My Lips}
{artist: Bethel Music}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Verse 1}
[C/E]Your love is devoted
[G]Like a ring of solid gold
[Am]Like a vow that is tested
[G]Like a covenant of old
[C/E]Your love is enduring
[G]through the winter rain
[Am]Beyond the Horizon
[G]With mercy for today

{comment: Pre-Chorus}
[F]Faithful, You have been
[C]Faithful, You will be
[G]You pledge Yourself to me and it's why I sing

{comment: Chorus}
[C]Your praise will ever be on my [Dm]lips,
ever be on my lips
[Am]Your praise will ever be on my [G]lips,
ever be on my lips

{comment: Verse 2}
[C/E]You father the orphan
[G]Your kindness made us whole
[Am]You shoulder our weakness
[G]As grace restores the soul
[C/E]You're making me like You
[G]Clothing me in white
[Am]Bringing beauty from ashes
[G]For you will have Your bride

{comment: Pre-Chorus}
[F]Faithful, You have been
[C]Faithful, You will be
[G]You pledge Yourself to me and it's why I sing

{comment: Chorus}
[C]Your praise will ever be on my [Dm]lips,
ever be on my lips
[Am]Your praise will ever be on my [G]lips,
ever be on my lips

{comment: Bridge}
[C]And You will be praised
[G]And You will be praised
[Am]With angels and saints
[F]We sing worthy are You, Lord
